{
  "date": "2025-11-04",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모해ㅐ",
      "en": "What are you doingg?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 오늘",
      "en": "Today I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안경을 새로 맞추고 왔엉",
      "en": "Went to get a new pair of glasses."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니",
      "en": "Because,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 원래 쓰던거",
      "en": "The pair I used before,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "알이 막 빠졌었잖앜ㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "The lenses kept falling out. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 뮤비찍으면서",
      "en": "And while filming the MV,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한쪽 다리도 부러진거야",
      "en": "One of the temples broke too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 코 지지대로만",
      "en": "So it was only hanging on"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "버티면서",
      "en": "By the nose pads."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기울어진 세상을 보면서",
      "en": "I was looking at a tilted world"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "썼는데",
      "en": "While wearing them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "드디어 새걸 마련했어",
      "en": "I finally got a new pair."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안경없는 삶이 너무 슬펐는데",
      "en": "Life without glasses was so sad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 날아갈거같아 헤헿",
      "en": "Now I feel like I could fly. Hehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭘로 샀냐궁?",
      "en": "You're asking what kind I got?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 핑크색에 빠져서",
      "en": "I've been into pink lately,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "핑크색 알 작은 뿔테로 바꿨어~",
      "en": "So I got small pink horn-rimmed glasses~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "초등학생들 인기상품이라고~",
      "en": "They're supposedly really popular with elementary school kids~"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "진짜야?..",
      "en": "Really?.."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "구라지~~",
      "en": "Just kidding~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이걸믿네~~~",
      "en": "You actually believed that~~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "걍 뿔테샀어",
      "en": "I just got black horn-rimmed glasses."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "검정",
      "en": "Black."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "상여자는 검정이줴",
      "en": "A cool woman wears black."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 새안경 적응중",
      "en": "I'm getting used to my new glasses now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "행복ㅋ",
      "en": "I'm happy. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 전에 쓰던건",
      "en": "But my old glasses"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 큰안경이였는데",
      "en": "Were really oversized."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이번엔 그냥 적당한거로 샀어",
      "en": "This time I bought a normal-sized pair."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 안경 큰게좋은데",
      "en": "I also like big glasses,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런테가 없드라",
      "en": "But they didn't have any frames like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이 근데 시력이 몇이야",
      "en": "By the way, what's your eyesight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 이번에 재고왔는데",
      "en": "I had it checked this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "-2.5??",
      "en": "Around -2.5?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그렇더라",
      "en": "That's what it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 난시가",
      "en": "But my astigmatism"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 심해서",
      "en": "Is really bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "두개로 보여",
      "en": "I see double."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "옆에서",
      "en": "Next to me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유빈언니가",
      "en": "Yubin-unnie"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배로 말걸어",
      "en": "Keeps talking with her stomach."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 꾸루룩꼬르륵꺄르륵",
      "en": "It keeps going 'gururuk, ggorureuk, kkyareureuk.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "너도 답장 ㄱㄱ",
      "en": "Reply back then. Go go."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "날때마다 뭐라고? 이렇게 하고있어",
      "en": "Every time it happens I go, 'What did you say?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다시는 안말해주더라",
      "en": "It never talks to me again afterward."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "유빈이가 이르는 중ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "Yubin is tattling on you. ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "유빈언니랑 같은방이야?",
      "en": "Do you share a room with Yubin-unnie?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "같은방은 아닌데",
      "en": "Not the same room,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "심심할때 서로 방 놀러가서",
      "en": "But when we're bored we visit each other's rooms."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "거의 같은방인느낌",
      "en": "It almost feels like we share one."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 유빈언니방에",
      "en": "But in Yubin-unnie's room,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 짐이많아서",
      "en": "I have so much of my stuff there."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "거의 2인실이얔ㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "It's basically a shared room. ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "칫솔도 있다며",
      "en": "I heard you even keep your toothbrush there."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞앜ㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ 서로 화장실에 칫솔 냅둠",
      "en": "Yep. ㅋㅋ We both leave toothbrushes in each other's bathrooms."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 근데 요즘 왤케 추운거야?",
      "en": "Seriously though, why is it so cold these days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미치겠어",
      "en": "It's driving me crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 추운거 별로 안좋아",
      "en": "I don't really like cold weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "여름에 태어나서 그른가",
      "en": "Maybe because you were born in summer."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아 여름여자라 ㅋ",
      "en": "That's right, I'm a summer girl. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "롱패딩 꺼낼거야 이제",
      "en": "I'm bringing out my long padded coat now."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데",
      "en": "But,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 제일 이쁜 계절이",
      "en": "The season where I look the prettiest"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가을인데",
      "en": "Is autumn."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "가을이 없어졌어",
      "en": "But autumn disappeared."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어디갔어 내 가을?",
      "en": "Where did my autumn go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "무슨 소리야 넌 항상 예뻐",
      "en": "What are you talking about? You're always pretty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아잉! 모랭!",
      "en": "Aing! What are you saying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "입고리 봐야한다 지금",
      "en": "I need to see the corners of your mouth right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하늘위에있어서 망원경 필요",
      "en": "They're so high up in the sky that you'll need a telescope."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 좋아하는 옷 스타일이",
      "en": "The clothing style I like"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다 가을 겨울 느낌이라",
      "en": "All has an autumn and winter vibe."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "솔직히 여름에는",
      "en": "Honestly, during summer,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 반팔에 트레이닝복",
      "en": "I just wear a T-shirt and sweatpants."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "입고 다니긴해",
      "en": "That's usually what I go around wearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그러면 가오를 위해 좀 얇게 입자",
      "en": "Then dress a little lighter for style."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러다 감기걸리면 책임질거야??",
      "en": "If I catch a cold because of that, are you going to take responsibility?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "옮겨도 돼?",
      "en": "Can I pass it on to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "옮는 건 괜찮은데 너 아픈 게 싫다",
      "en": "I don't mind catching it, I just don't like you being sick."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "멋있다",
      "en": "That's cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아프냐",
      "en": "Are you sick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 아프다",
      "en": "I'm sick too."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "아프니까 청춘이다...",
      "en": "Because you're sick, you're young..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아프면 환자긴해",
      "en": "Well, if you're sick, you are a patient."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제 눈내리고~",
      "en": "Soon it'll snow~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "크리스마스 오고~",
      "en": "Then Christmas will come~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러면",
      "en": "Then"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "캐롤들어야지~",
      "en": "We'll have to listen to Christmas carols~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "징글벨징글벨~징그러운벨",
      "en": "\"Jingle bells, jingle bells~ Gross bells~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "루돌프사슴코는 코딱지!",
      "en": "\"Rudolph the red-nosed reindeer's nose is a booger!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이거 아닌가",
      "en": "Isn't that how it goes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅎ",
      "en": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "불붙는다 했겠지렁이~",
      "en": "\"It would've caught on fire~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "개코 아니야.?.? ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "Isn't it 'dog nose' instead? ㅋㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아 맞당 ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "Ah, that's right. ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이거 스포라고..?",
      "en": "Is this considered a spoiler..?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "코딱..이거가?",
      "en": "The booger part...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋네…",
      "en": "Nice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응응",
      "en": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "산타 할래말래",
      "en": "Are you going to be Santa or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "애매하긴 해",
      "en": "It's kind of hard to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀 그렇긴 해",
      "en": "Yeah, I guess it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "겨울에 썰매 타기 좀 춥긴 해",
      "en": "Riding a sleigh in winter would be pretty cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "눈 너무 맞을거 같긴 해",
      "en": "We'd probably get covered in snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "울어서 좀 애매하긴해~",
      "en": "If you cry, it'd be a little awkward~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나쁜아이면 좀 그렇긴 해",
      "en": "If you're a bad kid, then yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "하연이도 나쁜아이아님? 빈이 울리고",
      "en": "Isn't Hayeon a bad kid too? You made Binnie cry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빈이도 선물 못받게하려고 그런거긴 해",
      "en": "I kind of did it so Binnie wouldn't get presents either."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "나쁜여자긴 해",
      "en": "You really are a bad girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그게 내 매력이긴해",
      "en": "That's part of my charm."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배지빌런ㅋ",
      "en": "Badge Villain. ㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "빌런인데 착한 그런거 알지",
      "en": "You know, a villain who's actually kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원래 빌런들이 마음이 여리고",
      "en": "Villains are usually soft-hearted."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "착한줄 알았던 애들이 반전이라구",
      "en": "The ones who seem nice are the ones with the real plot twist."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맑눈광",
      "en": "A clear-eyed psycho."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뒤에선 막 마법부리고있고 저주하고",
      "en": "Secretly casting magic and curses behind everyone's back."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔지알지",
      "en": "You know what I mean."
    },
        {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "클리셰 같은거야?",
      "en": "So it's like a cliché?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "클리셰처럼~",
      "en": "Just like a cliché~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대형 스포 뚜둔",
      "en": "Huge spoiler, dun dun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하 그냥 다 말해야지",
      "en": "Ha, I should just tell you everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 사실 제니스를 지배하는 악마고 지옥의 문을 열어서",
      "en": "I'm actually the demon that rules Zenith, and I open the gates of hell."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "엔더드래곤 잡고 엔딩임",
      "en": "Then I defeat the Ender Dragon and that's the ending."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고 멤버들 마크 캐릭터로변해서",
      "en": "After that, all the members turn into Minecraft characters."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "도티님 만남",
      "en": "And we meet Ddotty."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "호잇짜!",
      "en": "Hoit-cha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다말해서 어떠켕 재미없겠다ㅏ",
      "en": "Now that I've spoiled everything, it won't be fun anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "엔더드래곤 잡는 소리",
      "en": "Sure, 'defeating the Ender Dragon.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "억까악",
      "en": "Eokkaak!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "육까악 이라고",
      "en": "I meant to say 'Yukkaak.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자동완성아",
      "en": "Autocomplete..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "혼내주고 올게",
      "en": "I'm going to go scold it."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "억까를 얼마나 많이 썼으면 자동완성이 억까야",
      "en": "How often do you type 'eokka' for autocomplete to suggest it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "ㅠㅠ"
